    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24171" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intercălārĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		intercalaris, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for insertion</i>, <i>intercalary</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mensis,</span>”
				<i>an intercalary month</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					1, 19, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">37, 59, 2</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 40</span></i>; the same <i>absol.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intercalarius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 2, 52, § 130</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annus,</span>”
				<i>leap-year</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 47, 48, § 130</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">18, 25, 57,
				§ 207</span></i>.</div>
